    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black hole simulator is an idle game, you start as a small black hole and grow and evolve as you collect upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 tracks to listen to while you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an idle collection system that earns you gold every few seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a in depth upgrade system featuring evolutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in game achievements that give you rewards and steam acheivements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different evolutions pre galaxy sized update 16 different evolutions post galaxy sized update</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perk system that can also aid you in your destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 pets currently in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >threat level increases based on total kill count gain passive ability's over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >planetary system which also give you perks, buffs, and more enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hard mode enemy system which helps you progress the game faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple different levels taking you to different space biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >save system that will save your total gold and your threat level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >respec by saving and restarting your game. If you dont like your black hole you can always try a different one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >galaxy sized update- on may 14th I will be dropping the galaxy sized update which will add 8 new evolutions showcased in the new trailer. It will also add additional levels and the quest system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So how about it you ready to suck up the galaxy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black hole simulator is an idle game, you start as a small black hole and grow and evolve as you collect upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 tracks to listen to while you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an idle collection system that earns you gold every few seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a in depth upgrade system featuring evolutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in game achievements that give you rewards and steam acheivements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different evolutions pre galaxy sized update 16 different evolutions post galaxy sized update</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perk system that can also aid you in your destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 pets currently in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >threat level increases based on total kill count gain passive ability's over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >planetary system which also give you perks, buffs, and more enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hard mode enemy system which helps you progress the game faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple different levels taking you to different space biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >save system that will save your total gold and your threat level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >respec by saving and restarting your game. If you dont like your black hole you can always try a different one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >galaxy sized update- on may 14th I will be dropping the galaxy sized update which will add 8 new evolutions showcased in the new trailer. It will also add additional levels and the quest system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So how about it you ready to suck up the galaxy!</p>",
    "short_description": "Start as a small black hole suck up the galaxy and evolve into the legendary black hole!",
